+// S06 assessment dependency (native HOW, Declared typed assessment; common HOW
+// installed split proof obligation), through the canonical native semantic-stage
+// author-to-assessor path. The core semantic-stage publication is the unique
+// owner of `semantic-stage/native-assessment` and the core install holds its
+// schema asset. A case-local consumer Product owns no contract: its one-stage
+// SemanticJobLifecycle Program is semantic intake -> the first GraphFunction of
+// constructNativeSemanticStageGraphFunctions(stage, stageClose, assessmentClose)
+// -> canonical envelope_output, closed by the ordinary lifecyclePredicateRef.
+// Its members built by that constructor (and its local root) declare use. The
+// stage has no application_assessment capability, so no C2 evidence, default
+// governance, Construction or UAT fold is involved. The native work leaf runs as
+// the canonical constructor role and the assessment leaf as the assessor role
